{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run your dream sushi restaurant in a wild and cheeky simulation like no other!</strong> \ud83c\udf63</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Body Sushi</i>, a bold sushi restaurant simulator where your creativity, management skills, and a touch of mischief collide. Build, customize, and grow your sushi business\u2014but disaster strikes on opening day!\u00a0 Will you rise from the chaos or be served raw?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the owner, you'll prepare perfect sushi, manage the restaurant flow, and meet colorful, quirky characters with wild personalities and their own demands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/51b012027bf7376be9ca7c41260cb0fc.poster.avif?t=1768333396\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/51b012027bf7376be9ca7c41260cb0fc.webm?t=1768333396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/51b012027bf7376be9ca7c41260cb0fc.mp4?t=1768333396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/ca2ddd27034118b74721c7ac8473d46f.poster.avif?t=1768333396\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/ca2ddd27034118b74721c7ac8473d46f.webm?t=1768333396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\